Database [postgres]: Indext
Port [5432]: 
Username [postgres]: 
psql.bin (9.1.4)
Type &quot;help&quot; for help.

No entry for terminal type &quot;xterm&quot;;
using dumb terminal settings.
Indext=# Indext&lt;/home/david/Documents/pg_dump_indext.sql;
ERROR:  syntax error at or near &quot;Indext&quot;</code></pre></div><p>j&#039;ai crée à l&#039;avance la nouvelle base, mais ça marche pas!!</p><p>merci de votre aide</p>]]></content>
